Data sources used at run time (no data is shipped with this repository):

- Swiss commercial register (Zefix), via LINDAS, the linked-data service of
  the Swiss federal administration — https://lindas.admin.ch
  Source: Federal Office of Justice, Zefix. The dataset is published as
  open data under the terms "Open use. Must provide the source."

- Swiss Official Gazette of Commerce (SHAB/FOSC), via the Amtsblattportal
  API — https://www.amtsblattportal.ch
  Source: SECO, Swiss Official Gazette of Commerce. Data retrieved through
  this tool is not an official publication; only the publication on
  shab.ch / amtsblattportal.ch is authoritative.

Third-party software keeps its own licence; SearXNG (AGPL-3.0) runs as a
separate container and is not part of this code base.
